        "quote": "(a) Regulations Not Retroactive. The regulations prescribed by this chapter shall not be construed to require the removal, lowering or other changes or alteration of any structure or tree not conforming to the regulations as of May 13, 1980, or otherwise interfere with the continuance of nonconforming use.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.060:block:0#text",
